# Release signing for THIS project only. Lives outside git (chmod 600). Never commit or paste into chats.
#
# Unity does NOT save keystore passwords in the project, so a batch build (tools/build-aab.sh) can only sign
# when they are given here. Fill in all four lines (remove the leading #).
# Don't know where the keystore file is?  find ~ -name "*.keystore" 2>/dev/null
# (Unity 6's keystore manager can show "{dedicated}: name.keystore" in Player Settings; you still need the real file path.)
# Use the SAME upload key that Google Play already has for the game, or the upload is rejected.

#UNITY_KEYSTORE_PATH=/absolute/path/to/upload.keystore
#UNITY_KEYSTORE_PASS=
#UNITY_KEYALIAS_NAME=
#UNITY_KEYALIAS_PASS=
